DocList names the documents delivered with a system, which is the list validation teams check first.

- Markup: `<ul class="aq-docs">` with one `<li>` per document. It flows into two columns when there is room.
- Name each document as QA would: "Functional design specification (FDS)", "FAT protocol and report", "Material certificates (EN 10204 3.1)".
- Place it on `aq-band--sunken`.
